{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "Every data file the app reads, with where it comes from. kind: open-data (read from a published service), document (transcribed from a published report, with its pages), derived (built from the files in from), decision (a reviewed correction to the files in from), app (the app's own records). dateField: the field in the file that says when its data was pulled or published. Checked by tests/sources.test.js: a data file with no entry here fails the build.",
